  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfGroupCompanyHoldingLargestAmountOfInvestmentSharesInGroup contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">株式会社肥後銀行</jpcrp_cor:NameOfGroupCompanyHoldingLargestAmountOfInvestmentSharesInGroup>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfGroupCompanyHoldingSecondLargestAmountOfInvestmentSharesInGroup contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">株式会社鹿児島銀行</jpcrp_cor:NameOfGroupCompanyHoldingSecondLargestAmountOfInvestmentSharesInGroup>
  <jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesOtherThanThoseNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">株式分割のため、増加しております。</jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesOtherThanThoseNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearDuration" xsi:nil="true"/>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">ＳＯＭＰＯホールディングス株式会社</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">保有基準を全て充足。同社グループの保険商品窓口販売など事業上の連携関係の維持・強化を図るため、継続して保有しています。株式数増加の理由：株式分割による株式数増加。</jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
